  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSystem.DialogueData
  lines:
  - There it is.
  - <color=#FFB6C1><size=120%>The cake.
  - See? I told you it was real.
  - You didn't believe me, did you?
  - After everything we've been through...
  - I'm honestly a little hurt.
  - Well?
  - Go on.
  - You've earned it.
  - Take the cake.
